1. Revision 8.00 - Please?
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Once again, greetings to all you Nethack fans out there.  I've been getting a 
number of pieces of e-mail and several phone calls lately with people wanting 
to know when (if?) WCST will be coming out with a new revision of the 
Spoilers that is pertinent to Nethack v3.1.  Well, the good news is that I am 
in the process of writing revision 8.00 of the WCST Nethack Spoilers.  The 
better news is that revision 8.00 will be an almost complete re-write for 
version 3.1 of Nethack, with tons more detail than any previous revision of 
the Spoilers.  The best news of all is that I'm going to begin releasing 
parts of revision 8.00 within the next few days.  On top of all that, there 
really isn't any bad news!  (Unless you count the fact that revision 8.00 
isn't totally done to be bad news.)

Here's what's basically going to be happening:  I've finished a number of 
sections of revision 8.00.  I've decided that rather than waiting until 
they're totally finished, I'm going to start releasing the sections that are 
done, and then continue releasing sections as I complete them.  Once all of 
the sections have been finished, I will do a release of the complete text of 
revision 8.00, and the commercial version will also be released.

Each section, as it is released, will be mailed to each person on the WCST e-
mailing list, and will simultaneously be posted to rec.games.hack.  All 
sections are part of revision 8.00 of the WCST Nethack Spoilers, and are 
Copyright 1993 by me, all rights reserved, blah, blah, blah.  Distribution 
will be governed by the WCST Nethack Spoiler License Agreement, which is in 
one of the sections below.  The main gist of it is "copy all you like, don't 
make money from it, and don't distribute modified versions."

Anyways...  Keep checking your mailboxes, because the parts will be coming 
straight to those of you who are on the e-mailing list.

