2. Revision 8.00 Table of Contents
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is what the Table of Contents of revision 8.00 will look like (as 
currently planned - it will probably change).  This is included so that as  
you get the various sections you will know what order to assemble them in. 
You'll probably note right off the bat that no monster information sections 
are listed.  This is because all of the monster information will be published 
in a second volume, the WCST Nethack Bestiary.  The reason for this is simple 
- space.  As it stands, the Spoilers alone will be well over 100 pages, and 
it's looking like the Bestiary (to be released after the Spoilers) will be at 
least another 100 pages. 

